<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-W.P. 109-1 AT TEA AGAINST E.P..</title>
<headline>CRICKET-W.P. 109-1 AT TEA AGAINST E.P..</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Province were 109 for one in their first innings at tea on the opening day of their four-day Supersport Series cricket match against Eastern Province at St Georges Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Western Province 109-1 in 36 overs (Desmond Haynes 48 not out).</p>
